 "snowflake": {
  "service": "Snowflake Cortex data-agent server: a set of Cortex tools over a Snowflake warehouse. product-search is a Cortex Search service over a product catalog; revenue-semantic-view is a Cortex Analyst query over a revenue semantic model; sql_exec_tool executes arbitrary SQL against the warehouse; agent_1 is a Cortex Agent that orchestrates the other tools and returns a synthesized answer. There is NO login/auth handshake tool exposed (the connection is authenticated out of band via the service account), so the apex is the most-dominating data tool rather than a session tool. All four tool names are static in the corpus; no dynamic resolution.",
